  "description": "<p>⭐ <em>Discover the world of Japanese sake at MAP Maison in London with a guided tasting of premium sakes, paired with a welcome cocktail and expert insights.</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🍶 Welcome sake cocktail on arrival.<br>\r\n🥂 Guided tasting of three premium sakes (35ml each).<br>\r\n📖 Learn about the history, regions, breweries, and classifications of sake.<br>\r\n👨‍🏫 Led by a dedicated sake expert for a rich, informative experience.<br>\r\n🍴 Optional tapas menu available with pairings and combos to enjoy alongside your tasting.<br>\r\n✨ Perfect for both sake enthusiasts and curious beginners.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Date and time: Choose in the ticket selector<br>\r\n⏰ Duration: 1 hour 30 minutes<br>\r\n📍 Venue: MAP Maison<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nTake a seat at MAP Maison and embark on a flavorful journey through the art of Japanese sake. Begin with a refreshing sake cocktail before sampling three distinct premium sakes, each accompanied by detailed explanations from an expert guide. Along the way, you’ll explore sake’s history, classifications, and regional nuances, gaining a deeper appreciation for this iconic Japanese drink. Whether you’re new to sake or already a fan, this immersive tasting promises an engaging and delicious experience. Get your tickets now!</p>",
